1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:06,746
Tokenized stocks and ETFs now represent over three billion dollars onchain worldwide.
全球代币化股票与 ETF 的链上规模已超过三十亿美元。

2
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:13,091
In September alone, Solana processed around four point four billion dollars in tokenized stock trades.
仅九月，Solana 上的代币化股票交易量就达到约四十四亿美元。

3
00:00:13,355 --> 00:00:16,676
How can long-term holders participate in that activity?
长期持有者，怎样参与这些交易？

4
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:24,239
Meet ValueRange. AI turns company valuation into a plan for tokenized stocks on Solana.
认识 ValueRange：用 AI，把公司估值变成 Solana 股票代币的持仓策略。

5
00:00:24,507 --> 00:00:32,747
Keep shares for growth. Put part of the portfolio into AMM liquidity to convert shares and cash, and earn trading fees.
保留股票参与上涨，用部分资金提供 AMM 流动性，转换股票与现金，赚取交易手续费。

6
00:00:33,007 --> 00:00:37,879
The challenge: which ranges, how much capital, and when to adjust?
难点是：区间怎么定，资金怎么配，什么时候调整？

7
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:45,923
Every company creates value differently. Financial reports and research become a model built around its business.
每家公司的价值创造方式不同。财报与研究，转化为贴合公司业务的估值模型。

8
00:00:46,515 --> 00:00:51,553
AI combines that valuation with market data, current holdings, and your goals.
AI 将估值与市场数据、现有仓位和持有目标结合。

9
00:00:51,813 --> 00:01:01,565
Core manages a broad range. Active converts shares in stages. Cash preserves flexibility. Code checks the numbers; you review the plan.
Core 管理宽区间，Active 分段换仓，现金保留灵活性。程序核算，你来复核。

10
00:01:02,453 --> 00:01:09,939
Follow a five-year simulation, starting with ten thousand dollars and a share price of ninety-two dollars and two cents.
看一段五年模拟：本金一万美元，起始股价九十二点零二美元。

11
00:01:10,199 --> 00:01:17,607
On the rallies, the strategy converts shares into cash. On the pullbacks, available cash rebuilds inventory.
上涨时，策略逐步把股票转为现金；回落时，可用现金重新积累股票。

12
00:01:17,867 --> 00:01:26,383
Across two market cycles, the mix of shares, cash, and liquidity changes. In-range trading earns fees along the way.
经历两轮上涨与回落，股票、现金与流动性的比例持续变化，区间内成交累积手续费。

13
00:01:26,643 --> 00:01:31,046
This exchanges some upside exposure for fees and range management.
策略让出部分上涨敞口，换取手续费与区间管理的机会。

14
00:01:32,149 --> 00:01:37,957
At the end of year four, positive business news supports stronger growth and profitability.
第四年末，新的经营利好支持更强的增长与盈利。

15
00:01:38,217 --> 00:01:43,907
AI reviews the evidence, updates the valuation, and proposes new liquidity ranges.
AI 复核依据，更新估值中枢，并提出新的流动性区间。

16
00:01:44,167 --> 00:01:52,083
Core moves higher. Seventy percent of strategy principal goes to direct shares, and the old Active position is paused.
Core 区间上移，策略本金的百分之七十配置为直接持股，并暂停原有 Active 仓位。

17
00:01:52,348 --> 00:01:57,380
The plan responds to the company, instead of keeping yesterday’s ranges forever.
策略跟随公司变化，不再始终沿用过去的区间。

18
00:01:58,296 --> 00:02:03,299
Five years later, the share price reaches two hundred and fifty-one dollars.
五年结束，股价来到二百五十一美元。

19
00:02:03,559 --> 00:02:12,211
The revised portfolio reaches about sixty-six thousand nine hundred dollars, versus twenty-seven thousand three hundred from simply holding shares.
修正后的组合约六万六千九百美元，纯持股约两万七千三百美元。

20
00:02:12,503 --> 00:02:18,260
That is about thirty-nine thousand six hundred dollars more, on the same price path.
在同一条价格路径上，组合比纯持股多约三万九千六百美元。

21
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:25,779
Nearly four thousand dollars in trading fees are already included. The rest reflects holdings and range decisions.
其中已包含近四千美元交易手续费，其余差额来自持仓与区间决策。

22
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:31,098
Keeping the original strategy finishes at about forty-one thousand five hundred dollars.
维持原策略，期末资产约四万一千五百美元。

23
00:02:32,180 --> 00:02:36,821
The workflow keeps reviewing news, financial reports, and portfolio records.
工作流持续复核新闻、财报与仓位记录。

24
00:02:37,215 --> 00:02:43,025
Track asset value. Explain the return. Feed the findings into the next strategy review.
记录净值，拆解收益，把发现反馈到下一轮策略复核。

25
00:02:43,415 --> 00:02:47,447
Research, decisions, and revisions remain traceable.
研究、决策与修正，都保留可追溯的依据。

26
00:02:48,679 --> 00:02:51,883
Next, bring this strategy to more people.
下一步，让更多人用上这套策略。

27
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:56,760
Deposit into a managed vault, with the strategy run for you.
通过策略金库存入资金，由金库代为管理策略。

28
00:02:57,039 --> 00:03:02,425
Or keep custody, with an agent helping you trade within limits you set.
也可以保留自托管，让 Agent 在你设定的权限内协助交易。

29
00:03:02,699 --> 00:03:06,145
Research   Allocate   Adapt
研究   配置   持续修正

30
00:03:07,263 --> 00:03:11,457
ValueRange — A plan for how you hold
ValueRange，让持有更有章法